       }
      ],
      "text": "Boxed warning:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " sz · cardiopulm arrest & death in children under 3 yr when ⍉given in strict adherence to dosing; generally ⍉for teething pain"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
